    "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY ON STEAM USING THE REMOTE PLAY TOGETHER FEATURE</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/89153536adbf325350a74ade4d0af4ac.avif?t=1681302368\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DESIGNED AS 2-PLAYER CO-OP</strong></h2>Co-op mode for 2 players is not a supplementary or optional way of playing Njorun's Will - it is rather the only intended way to do it. All the game mechanics and experiences are designed and built with &quot;co-opness&quot; in mind.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/2c54dc2890ed0b4534ec363aef049792.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/2c54dc2890ed0b4534ec363aef049792.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TELEKINETIC ABILITIES</strong></h2>Playing as K\u00e6ra Scouts, you can telekinetically manipulate each other as well as various objects in the game. Use this power to overcome the obstacles and help each other.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/9b01cc419dcedacfeea70ee50e7cff4f.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/9b01cc419dcedacfeea70ee50e7cff4f.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHALLENGING COMBAT</strong></h2>Study the enemies and coordinate your actions to be victorious in fights. Mistakes are costly, resources are limited.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/e9ada1bc8dd06c7b84ef94aa3af7f581.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/e9ada1bc8dd06c7b84ef94aa3af7f581.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORATION AND INVESTIGATION</strong></h2>Your primary goal is to solve the mystery. Observe the surroundings, explore the houses and dungeons, talk to strangers. Find the answers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/0eecccf09994e9d6db7c4e0c9095587d.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/0eecccf09994e9d6db7c4e0c9095587d.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLATFORMING AND PUZZLES</strong></h2>You will need to perform high-precision movements and jumps to traverse the locations. At times, moving forward won't be possible without scratching your head and solving a puzzle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/4240359c54116c3361b067622f48767b.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/4240359c54116c3361b067622f48767b.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WANT TO KNOW MORE? JOIN OUR DISCORD COMMUNITY!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/d7b06272dfa8b75808a0b6973fbe0dbd.avif?t=1681302368\" /></div></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DESIGNED AS 2-PLAYER CO-OP</strong></h2>Co-op mode for 2 players is not a supplementary or optional way of playing Njorun's Will - it is rather the only intended way to do it. All the game mechanics and experiences are designed and built with &quot;co-opness&quot; in mind.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/2c54dc2890ed0b4534ec363aef049792.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/2c54dc2890ed0b4534ec363aef049792.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TELEKINETIC ABILITIES</strong></h2>Playing as K\u00e6ra Scouts, you can telekinetically manipulate each other as well as various objects in the game. Use this power to overcome the obstacles and help each other.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/9b01cc419dcedacfeea70ee50e7cff4f.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/9b01cc419dcedacfeea70ee50e7cff4f.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHALLENGING COMBAT</strong></h2>Study the enemies and coordinate your actions to be victorious in fights. Mistakes are costly, resources are limited.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/e9ada1bc8dd06c7b84ef94aa3af7f581.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/e9ada1bc8dd06c7b84ef94aa3af7f581.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORATION AND INVESTIGATION</strong></h2>Your primary goal is to solve the mystery. Observe the surroundings, explore the houses and dungeons, talk to strangers. Find the answers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/0eecccf09994e9d6db7c4e0c9095587d.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/0eecccf09994e9d6db7c4e0c9095587d.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLATFORMING AND PUZZLES</strong></h2>You will need to perform high-precision movements and jumps to traverse the locations. At times, moving forward won't be possible without scratching your head and solving a puzzle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/4240359c54116c3361b067622f48767b.poster.avif?t=1681302368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/4240359c54116c3361b067622f48767b.webm?t=1681302368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WANT TO KNOW MORE? JOIN OUR DISCORD COMMUNITY!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1678040/extras/d7b06272dfa8b75808a0b6973fbe0dbd.avif?t=1681302368\" /></div></h2>",
